<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Ao longo dos <strong>16.090 metros<\/strong> integralmente disputados em asfalto, vais partir do cora\u00e7\u00e3o pombalino de <strong>Vila Real de Santo Ant\u00f3nio<\/strong>, percorrer a EN 122 e a EN 125-6 atrav\u00e9s do concelho vizinho de <strong>Castro Marim<\/strong> e viver o momento alto da competi\u00e7\u00e3o com a travessia a p\u00e9 do tabuleiro da <strong>Ponte Internacional do Guadiana<\/strong> sobre o estu\u00e1rio do rio que divide os dois pa\u00edses. J\u00e1 em territ\u00f3rio espanhol, na prov\u00edncia da Andaluzia, o percurso desce em dire\u00e7\u00e3o ao centro urbano de <strong>Ayamonte<\/strong>, passando pela Ronda Felipe VI e pelo Muelle de Portugal at\u00e9 cortar a meta instalada na <strong>Plaza de La Ribera<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o desta cl\u00e1ssica peninsular \u00e9 assegurada conjuntamente pela <strong>Comiss\u00e3o Mista de Desportos de Vila Real de Santo Ant\u00f3nio, Castro Marim e Ayamonte<\/strong> \u2014 composta pela <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Vila Real de Santo Ant\u00f3nio<\/strong>, <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Castro Marim<\/strong>, <strong>Ayuntamiento de Ayamonte<\/strong>, <strong>Grupo Desportivo Pic-Nic<\/strong> e <strong>Patronato Municipal de Deportes de Ayamonte<\/strong>. Limitada a um pelot\u00e3o m\u00e1ximo de 1.000 participantes e aberta a atletas populares, federados e em cadeira de rodas, a prova disponibiliza transporte de guarda-roupa desde a partida em Portugal at\u00e9 \u00e0 chegada em Espanha, abastecimentos aos km 5, 10 e 13 e tempo limite de 2 horas.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data & Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">8 de Novembro de 2026 \u00e0s 10:00<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Pra\u00e7a Marqu\u00eas de Pombal, Vila Real de Santo Ant\u00f3nio (Partida) \u2013 Plaza de La Ribera, Ayamonte (Meta), Faro<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: fle